Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: apps/lib/engine_loader.c
Line: 86
Function: engine_open
Bug type: stack-buffer-overflow
CWE: CWE-121
Explanation: Copies an unbounded-length engine ID into a fixed 256-byte stack buffer without checking length. engineid_l is computed as q - p and may exceed 255; strncpy(engineid, p, engineid_l) overflows engineid, and the subsequent engineid[engineid_l] = '\0' write also goes out of bounds when engineid_l >= 256. An attacker can trigger this with a URI having an engine ID >255 bytes before the next ':'.

Source context:
